{"id":"gj3j44312r6834ptz97lb1dh6","title":"中国与美国讨论关税与农业贸易","originalTitle":"China, US discuss tariffs, farm trade ahead of Xi-Trump meeting","summary":"中国和美国在周五的贸易理事会上讨论了关税减免、农业贸易等问题，但未达成具体协议。双方计划继续利用该机制解决贸易问题，扩大合作。尽管有协议要求中国每年购买170亿美元的美国农产品，但中国今年购买美国农产品的数量仍可能降至七年来的最低点。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"CNBC Top News"},"links":{"original":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/14/china-us-tariffs-xi-trump-meeting.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T08:16:44.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T08:55:44.105Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T08:55:44.105Z","category":"macro","tags":["政策发布"],"score":17,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c088c54b-373b-4d76-bab2-2dbfb3a849c4","title":"中美未达成关税与农业贸易协议 中国进口美农产品或创新低"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c088c54b-373b-4d76-bab2-2dbfb3a849c4","title":"中美未达成关税与农业贸易协议 中国进口美农产品或创新低"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fol1xcb66aIo","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}